     "body": "Sibling of the Providers fix for outloudvi's report (Discord #feedback): on the main window, \"More in Plugins\" now always opens Discover (pluginQuery(\"\") no longer returns before setting the tab).\n\nIn panel mode openPlugins(q) in app.js calls api(\"window/main?view=plugins\") instead, which opens the main window on Plugins without any tab, so plugins.js restores magpie.pluginTab (Built-in, Installed…) from localStorage. The panel path should open Discover too, e.g. by carrying the query/tab in the window/main call.\n\nNot changed in the Providers fix: app.js has no bytes of budget left.",
